    "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">W</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mi>Δ</mi> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">f</mtext> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">i</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext> <mo>∞</mo> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mtext> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mtext> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mtext> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mtext> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mtext> </msub> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>as</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Upon integration, potential at point P will be obtained as given below<br /><br />Let dM be the mass of small ring as shown<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">dM</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">M</